		return `<p>Welcome to the GENERATION Survey ${yearToday}.</p>
		<p>This survey is being conducted by the Australian National University (ANU), Social Research Centre (SRC) and the Australian Council for Education Research (ACER) on behalf of the Department of Education (DoE).</p>
		${ins1}
		<p>GENERATION is a national study that follows the journey of young Australians, as they transition to life beyond school. This landmark study aims to reflect the collective experience of young Australians – while providing both participants and educators valuable insights into young people’s career interests and post-school life.</p>
		<p>The study began in 2022 with a group of Year 10 students. Now in its fifth wave in 2026, we’re asking about your post-school activities, including any study you’ve undertaken and whether you’ve been working.</p>
